  rect rgba(214,39,40,0.15)
    app-)mon: connect(udp, 140.82.121.6:0) — trapped
    Note over mon: no rule decides it,<br/>port 0:<br/>a sorting probe
    mon->>sock: pidfd_getfd: a copy of the socket
    mon->>sock: shutdown(SHUT_WR)
    mon->>sock: connect(140.82.121.6:0)
    mon--)app: emulate: connected, on the copy
  end
  app->>sock: getsockname()
  sock->>app: 192.168.1.10: the source<br/>the kernel picked
  app->>sock: send(…)
  sock->>app: EPIPE
